## Defect Category Definitions

### Developer Defect Categories (DEF-XXX)

| Category | Description | Common Symptoms | Key Questions |
|----------|-------------|-----------------|---------------|
| **Functional** | Core business logic incorrect or missing | Wrong output, missing validation, incomplete workflow | Does the feature work as specified? |
| **API/Integration** | External/internal API communication issues | 4xx/5xx errors, wrong data format, sync failures | Does the API behave per contract? |
| **Architecture** | Design, structure, or pattern problems | Tight coupling, wrong layer, scalability issues | Is the code organized correctly? |
| **Security** | Vulnerabilities and auth/authz issues | Unauthorized access, data leaks, injection | Can attackers exploit this? |
| **Performance** | Speed, memory, resource consumption | Slow responses, high CPU/memory, timeouts | Is it fast and efficient enough? |
| **Accessibility** | WCAG compliance and assistive tech support | Screen reader issues, no keyboard nav, contrast | Can all users access this? |
| **Data Integrity** | Data accuracy and consistency | Wrong calculations, duplicates, orphans | Is the data correct and consistent? |
| **Error Handling** | Exception management and user feedback | Crashes, silent failures, poor messages | Does it fail gracefully? |
| **Compatibility** | Browser, device, OS support | Works in Chrome, broken in Safari | Does it work everywhere? |
| **i18n** | Multi-language and locale support | Wrong translations, bad date formats | Does it work globally? |
| **Concurrency** | Parallel execution issues | Race conditions, deadlocks | Does it work under load? |
| **Observability** | Logging, monitoring, telemetry | Missing audit trail, no metrics | Can we debug/monitor it? |
| **Configuration** | Settings and environment issues | Wrong defaults, env-specific bugs | Is it configured correctly? |
| **Dependencies** | Third-party package issues | CVEs, version conflicts, deprecations | Are dependencies healthy? |

### QA Issue Categories (QA-XXX)

| Category | Description | Common Symptoms | Key Questions |
|----------|-------------|-----------------|---------------|
| **Infrastructure** | Test framework, CI/CD, build systems | Pipeline failures, runner crashes, build timeouts | Is the test infrastructure working? |
| **Tooling** | Test tool bugs, limitations, config | Tool can't interact with component, version issues | Is the test tool working correctly? |
| **Mocking** | Stub/mock incomplete or incorrect | Missing method, wrong return value, state issues | Do mocks behave like real services? |
| **Test Data** | Test data quality, seeding, cleanup | Invalid seeds, insufficient scenarios, data leaks | Is test data valid and isolated? |
| **Environment** | Local vs CI differences, resources | Works locally fails CI, memory issues, port conflicts | Are environments consistent? |
| **Credentials** | API keys, test accounts, certificates | Expired keys, locked accounts, cert issues | Are credentials valid and current? |
| **Third-party** | External services, APIs, sandboxes | Service unavailable, rate limits, API changes | Are external dependencies available? |
| **Flaky Tests** | Intermittent failures, timing issues | Passes sometimes, race conditions, animation waits | Is the test deterministic? |
| **Test Execution** | Parallel execution, ordering, isolation | Tests interfere, ordering dependencies, state leaks | Do tests run independently? |
| **Test Performance** | Slow tests, resource consumption | Suite too slow, memory-intensive tests | Are tests efficient? |
| **Test Coverage** | Missing tests, coverage gaps | Feature untested, metrics inaccurate | Is test coverage adequate? |
| **Reporting** | Results, artifacts, dashboards | Missing screenshots, reports not generated | Can we see test results? |
| **Browser/Device** | Browser availability, device farms | Browser not in CI, device farm connection issues | Can we test all targets? |
| **a11y Testing** | Accessibility testing tools | axe-core misconfigured, screen reader unavailable | Can we test accessibility? |
| **Perf Testing** | Load/performance test infrastructure | k6 errors, no baseline, resource limits | Can we test performance? |
| **Security Testing** | SAST/DAST tools, scanners | Snyk not running, ZAP incomplete | Can we test security? |
| **API Testing** | Postman, Newman, contract tests | Collections outdated, contract verification failing | Can we test APIs? |
| **Maintenance** | Outdated tests, selector rot, tech debt | Tests reference removed code, selectors broken | Are tests maintained? |
| **Documentation** | Test docs, setup guides, runbooks | Unclear purpose, can't run from docs | Is testing documented? |

