## Frequency/Reproducibility

How often does the defect occur?

| Frequency | Description | Example |
|-----------|-------------|---------|
| **Always** | 100% reproducible | Form validation fails every time |
| **Often** | >50% of attempts | Intermittent timeout on slow network |
| **Sometimes** | 10-50% of attempts | Race condition under load |
| **Rarely** | <10% of attempts | Edge case with specific data |
| **Once** | Occurred once, cannot reproduce | May need more investigation |

