## Attachments and Evidence

When possible, include:

| Type | Format | When to Include |
|------|--------|-----------------|
| **Screenshots** | PNG/JPG | UI defects, error dialogs |
| **Videos** | MP4/WebM | Complex repro steps, timing issues |
| **Log Files** | TXT/LOG | Server errors, stack traces |
| **Trace Files** | ZIP | Playwright traces for E2E failures |
| **Network Captures** | HAR | API issues, timeout problems |
| **Test Output** | TXT | Full test run output |

Store in: `QA Tests/Defect Evidence/DEF-XXX/` or `QA Tests/Defect Evidence/QA-XXX/`

