## Regression Classification

| Type | Description | Action |
|------|-------------|--------|
| **New Defect** | Never worked correctly | Normal priority |
| **Regression** | Previously worked, now broken | Higher priority - investigate recent changes |
| **Intermittent** | Works sometimes, fails sometimes | Document conditions, may need load testing |
| **Environment-Specific** | Only fails in certain environments | Document environment differences |

