## Metrics and Reporting

Track these metrics weekly/sprint:

| Metric | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| **Open Defects** | Total open by severity |
| **Defect Aging** | Days open (avg, max) |
| **Resolution Rate** | Defects closed / defects opened |
| **Regression Rate** | Regressions / total defects |
| **Test Coverage** | Tests blocked by defects |
| **Mean Time to Resolve** | Avg days from open to verified |

